sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant W as Web app
    participant O as Orders API
    participant P as Payment provider

    C->>W: Place order
    W->>O: POST /orders
    O->>O: #nbsp;
    Note left of O: Write the order and reserve stock
    O->>P: Charge card
    alt Card accepted
        P-->>O: Payment captured
        O-->>W: 201 Created
        W-->>C: Show confirmation
    else Card declined
        P-->>O: Declined
        O->>O: #nbsp;
        Note left of O: Release the reserved stock
        O-->>W: 402 Payment required
        W-->>C: Ask for another card
    end
